<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Jefferson Smurfit Corp Q1 net loss $7 mln.</title>
<headline>Jefferson Smurfit Corp Q1 net loss $7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			    (million $ unless stated)</p>
<p> Earnings per shr ($)   0.06 loss	    vs 0.48 profit</p>
<p> Net income		 7.0 loss	     vs 53.0 profit</p>
<p> Net sales		  778		    vs 916</p>
<p> Income from operations 39		     vs 138</p>
<p> Net interest expense   47		     vs 51</p>
<p> Provision for tax	1 credit	     vs 34 charge</p>
<p>NOTE - Jefferson Smurfit Corporation is a 46.5 percent-owned associate of Irish-based paper and packaging manufacturer Jefferson Smurfit Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
